   1 # Seeded growth example
   2 
   3 An unattended model grown from an owner-reviewed vocabulary, used by
   4 "Starting from a reviewed vocabulary" in
   5 `src/gnd/skills/gnd-model-from-text/references/unattended-growth.md`.
   6 
   7 - `seed.orm.yaml`: the reviewed vocabulary. Version 4, not unattended; its one
   8   constraint is `explicit`, `confirmed` and `alethic`, with `reviewed_in`.
   9 - `root.orm.yaml`: the growth root. Version 5, `source.mode: unattended`,
  10   `reviewer: none`; it includes the seed by pin and holds nothing of its own,
  11   so it declares no document yet.
  12 - `round-1.document.txt`, `round-1.proposal.json`: round 1 declares the
  13   document and adds an Author value type and "Author writes WorkKey", with
  14   spans and two sample rows.
  15 - `round-2.document.txt`, `round-2.proposal.json`: round 2 binds the root as
  16   round 1 publishes it, declares its document and attaches a `sample`,
  17   `proposed`, `deontic` mandatory constraint to the seed's fact type.
  18 - `population.json`, `policy.json`, `receipts.json`: a population of the grown
  19   root, and a two-judge policy with approving receipts that bind it.
  20 
  21 From a copy of this folder (the commands write into it):
  22 
  23 ```bash
  24 gnd validate root.orm.yaml
  25 gnd evolve preview root.orm.yaml round-1.proposal.json --workspace . --records records --out preview-1.json --policy additive
  26 gnd evolve apply root.orm.yaml round-1.proposal.json --preview preview-1.json --workspace . --records records --policy additive
  27 gnd evolve preview root.orm.yaml round-2.proposal.json --workspace . --records records --out preview-2.json --policy additive
  28 gnd evolve apply root.orm.yaml round-2.proposal.json --preview preview-2.json --workspace . --records records --policy additive
  29 gnd validate root.orm.yaml --document round-1.document.txt --document round-2.document.txt --require-documents
  30 gnd check root.orm.yaml population.json
  31 gnd judgments check root.orm.yaml population.json --policy policy.json --receipts receipts.json --trusted-root .
  32 ```
